<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Token Cost Breakdown</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix A Token Cost Breakdown ‣ Think Anywhere in Code Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> provides a detailed breakdown of reasoning token costs. For GRPO and CoT, the token cost consists entirely of upfront thinking tokens. For <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Think-Anywhere</span>, we separately report the upfront thinking length and the <span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;thinkanywhere&gt;</span> block length. The upfront thinking phase of <span id="A1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Think-Anywhere</span> is substantially shorter than that of GRPO and CoT across benchmarks, and the additional <span id="A1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;thinkanywhere&gt;</span> tokens are modest in comparison, resulting in a net reduction in total reasoning token usage.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Breakdown of reasoning token costs. For <span id="A1.T6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Think-Anywhere</span>, the two numbers denote upfront thinking length + <span id="A1.T6.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;thinkanywhere&gt;</span> block length.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T6.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T6.6.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.6.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Method</span></th>
<th id="A1.T6.6.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.6.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">HumanEval</span></th>
<th id="A1.T6.6.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.6.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MBPP</span></th>
<th id="A1.T6.6.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.6.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LeetCode</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
